SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] CCBHC Planning\, Development & Implementation (SM-26-014) — outreach window (award list ~2026-11-15)
DESCRIPTION:The application window closed 2026-08-17 and SAMHSA's FY27 forecast has no CCBHC successor. What's left is the post-award play: about 94 new CCBHCs are expected to be funded around Nov 15\, 2026\, with up to $1M/yr for up to 4 years. Allowable Activity #3 (training partnerships\, continuing education) lets them buy MORE training as a line item.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 12.0\nhttps://www.samhsa.gov/sites/default/files/grants/pdf/fy-2026-ccbhc-pdi-sm-26-014.pdf
